mill-liberty-3.logic.r2: argue/scope: A3: read with the obligation on its consequent alone, first_done ∧ good_fruits → O modest_belief, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, O(first_done ∧ good_fruits → modest_belief), C (S9) does not follow: it needs the ought on the consequent alone (narrow scope), not only on the conditional (wide), and which the sentence means decides the argument
